            "detailed_description": "Have you ever think of a game ‘Tetris’ that you can play it all day when you're a kid.It brought a lot of joy to the children.<br>‘Block Legend’  game method reference ‘Tetris’,With immersive VR experience,Use Block to build bridges to go to the treasure house .Conquer monsters and win treasures。<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Tetris</strong><br>Change the original way of play.The elimination blocks will stack up to the button,The longer of player's time and the space is smaller. Reach a certain amount quantity and to pass, not need all full. <br></li><li><strong>Action combat</strong><br>Handheld weapon with the monster face to face combat, VR immersive combat experience,Winning or losing depends on your operation. Various weapons bring diversity combat experience.<br></li><li><strong>Dual-weapon system</strong><br>It can carry two weapons at the same time。A variety of weapons can be arbitrary collocation ， 1+1&gt;2.<br></li><li><strong>Ranking list. </strong><br>The higher the rank, the higher the honor. </li></ul>",
